• Governing Law & Dispute Resolution: {governing_law}
• BIT (Bilateral Investment Treaty) Status: {bit_status}
• Stabilisation Clause: {stabilisation_clause}
• Sovereign Guarantee Quality: {sovereign_guarantee}
• ICSID / Arbitration Enforcement Regime: {icsid_arbitration}
