— Coverage & Peril Risk —
• CEND / Expropriation Risk: {cend_risk}
• Sovereign Non-Payment / Contract Frustration: {sovereign_nonpayment_risk}
• Currency Inconvertibility (Transfer Restriction): {currency_transfer_risk}
• Political Violence (Physical Damage / BI): {pv_physical_risk}
• Forced Abandonment Risk: {forced_abandonment_risk}

— Transaction & Financial Strength —
• Commodity / Goods Type: {commodity_type}
• Offtake Agreement Quality: {offtake_agreement_quality}
• Security Package & Collateral: {security_collateral}
• Repayment Structure: {repayment_structure}
• Financial Model IRR and Viability: {financial_model_irr}
• Hedge Arrangements (Currency / Commodity): {hedge_arrangements}
• Payment Terms & Trigger Event: {payment_trigger}
• Bank Margin / Pricing: {bank_margin}

— Insured & Broker Quality —
• Prior CPRI Claims History (5 years): {prior_claims_history}
• Emerging Market / CPRI Experience (Insured): {em_experience}
• Risk Management / ERM Maturity (Insured): {erm_maturity}
• Corporate Governance & Financial Transparency: {corp_governance}
• ABC Compliance & Integrity Record: {abc_compliance}

— Supporting Documentation —
• Documents Available to Underwriters: {supporting_documents}
• Third-party Reports Referenced: {third_party_reports}

• Rules Engine Score: using your analysis, provide a Risk Score on a scale of 1000

Provide:
  1) Executive risk narrative
  2) Top 3 risk drivers
  3) Coverage gaps and missing information
  4) Underwriting concerns and deal structure red flags
  5) Sublimit / indemnity / waiting period recommendations
  6) Loss control and risk mitigation priorities

Format as JSON.
